---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Conduit Work" description="Field-bent EMT and rigid conduit banks laid out, pulled, terminated and tested by our own electricians." path="/conduit/">
<section id="conduit"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Electrical</p>
    <h1>Conduit work you'd be proud to leave exposed.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Parking structures put every run on display. Our electricians lay out, bend and strap EMT and rigid banks so every offset matches and every run stays on line, from the gear to the last stall.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cgrid">
    <figure class="lead"><img src="/c-lead.jpg" alt="Overhead conduit bank sweeping across a parking structure ceiling to rows of Tesla Superchargers" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Tesla Supercharger · parking structure</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="tall"><img src="/c-6.jpg" alt="Vertical conduit riser running up the face of a parking structure" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Riser up the structure · Sherman Oaks</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/c-1.jpg" alt="Parallel EMT conduit rack sweeping around a column" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Sherman Oaks · 44 stalls</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/c-2.jpg" alt="Stacked conduit bank with matched offsets" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Matched offsets</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/c-7.jpg" alt="Concentric conduit bends on a strut rack" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Concentric bends on strut</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/c-8.jpg" alt="Two conduit riser banks running up a parking structure to a row of twelve power cabinets" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Twin risers to 12 cabinets</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/c-4.jpg" alt="Rigid conduit stub-up bank on a concrete pad" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Rigid stub-up bank</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/c-9.jpg" alt="Electrician on a scissor lift installing an overhead conduit bank in a parking structure" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Overhead bank going in</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <div class="cpoints">
    <div><h3>Laid out before it's bent</h3><p>Runs planned from the drawings so banks stay parallel and clear of structure, lighting and sprinklers.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Field bent by our electricians</h3><p>EMT and rigid up to large-diameter sizes, with concentric bends and matched offsets across the bank.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Pulled, terminated, tested</h3><p>Wire pulls, terminations, torque logs and testing by the same crew that installed the raceway.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
